# Universal .gitattributes for monorepos.
# Keep entries broad. If a single component needs project-specific
# attributes, add a local .gitattributes in that directory.
#
# GitHub picks rich-diff renderers (images, PDF, ipynb, CSV, geojson, stl,
# mermaid in markdown) by file extension. There is no .gitattributes knob to
# force rich diff on or off; the toggle is per-user-per-file in the diff UI.
# This file controls line endings, binary marking, linguist stats, and which
# files collapse by default in PR diffs.

# ---- Default ----
* text=auto eol=lf

# ---- Source: force LF ----
*.rs        text eol=lf
*.toml      text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
*.mdx       text eol=lf
*.txt       text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.jsonc     text eol=lf
